    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed33d54a01b132ff5489bb94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为有了与你一同驰骋过的经典级……\n才成就了现在的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "881d01e08c7bd054b86f4dd960fe71ea701039194523096ec67298bea990a827",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
