    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d39a3e2927ed37f2860e54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――而今天，我将与你展开一场热战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ee646a8d3f07e8707b3b560a9fad4c529604fb4d30c80966f85d0edd914ef9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59de17bd12018d61595219a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面向维多利亚英里赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1591689a7be58346cd0c5f7f46fa08c1cd5c7b4edbdb40cfb3551a0adf7259",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fde582343f16d2e7b3d68f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北方的大地。札幌赛场。\n虽然吹过的微风十分凉爽，但会场的火热气氛中，\n却隐隐带有一种迫切的色彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dc8d93afffe1fe4c23e1a9dfb39c72d3c591e9ed5927c1ade83f1087c6a8df3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e8a0be93a80b2839fa5746",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9eb6518e94670473e15bc84b7c6dc3f58687c51fb543b0e89b34018813d2d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f57e93bd3208d5897af77a71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『红色梦想她，没问题吧……？』\n『虽然不希望她太勉强自己……』『现在，\n也只能祈祷能看到她平安无事的身影了呢……』",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8e477e4b56d62cf306e6ecd857bfec860cc5210a027e9bde180a857bad8351",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c80c8578b66906d2bd5949d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5020441e758dd5bda3c9e47666e17b05f8b71b8aa3e416da7e0196d5a2fc03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
