      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……别别别，别来这套啦。\n这又不是什么关心不关心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb06dc02027aa8231b9f063537e1a1373602c965ca3575e9bdc0bd5106ff2f2e",
